  beloved stephen dies at the hand of  cassilius just before his last breath  steven bequeaths a cloak of levitation  to clear she takes his name and receives  his blessing to become the sorcerer  supreme clear strange is currently  running the show in the comics in the  strange series and this very well could  mean theron takes on the mantle as  sorcerer supreme in the nia mcu future  this is a trend that's been going on  with some of our beloved infinity saga  characters so why wouldn't the  sorcerer's supreme mantle be passed on  something would have to happen to wang  for this to happen in the mcu so we'll  have to wait to see what kevin feige and  company have planned if clear taking  over is a real thing that is with sam  wilson as the new captain america kate  bishop as the new hawkeye angelina  bellova as our new black widow basically  it would make sense that they're on to  take over benedict cumberbatch's role  for now mum is a word on theron's  involvement in any future mcu films she  did cryptically tweets that the cat was  out of the bag but has yet to hint that  she might be showing up in more projects  our guess she definitely is and she  might be donning the cloak of levitation  sooner than we think check out one of  our newest videos right here plus even  more looper videos about your favorite  mcu movies are coming soon subscribe to  our youtube channel and hit the bell so  you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

